# Flohg — MVP Monorepo

This repo contains:
- api (NestJS + TypeORM + Postgres/PostGIS + Redis)
- mobile (Flutter)
- admin (Next.js)
- docs (OpenAPI, architecture, runbook)

## Quickstart (local)

Prereqs: Docker, Node 20+, pnpm or npm, Flutter stable.

### API
cd api
cp .env.example .env
docker compose up -d
pnpm i
pnpm run build
pnpm run migrate
pnpm run seed
pnpm run start:dev

API docs at [localhost](http://localhost:8080/docs)

### Mobile
cd mobile
cp .env.example .env
flutter pub get
flutter run -d <device>

Android emulator base URL uses 10.0.2.2 to reach localhost.

### Admin
cd admin
cp .env.example .env.local
pnpm i
pnpm run dev

### Webhooks
Use ngrok to expose [localhost](http://localhost:8080) and configure Paystack webhooks:
ngrok http 8080 → https://<id>.ngrok.io/payments/webhook/paystack
